# Build context exclusions for docker/Dockerfile.compiler (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the
# Dockerfile; the context is the repository root). Keeps local installs, dev databases and build caches out
# of the context and, above all, out of the image.
.git
.claude
**/node_modules
**/data
**/builds
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
